sfwbar (1.0~beta17+git20260910+flickos10~test1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * FlickOS patch: taskbars, trays and pagers update when something
    changes instead of every 100 ms, and widgets whose value and style
    never change aren't re-evaluated every second. An idle Redmond-style
    bar drops from about 1,200 wakeups a minute to under 10.
  * FlickOS patch: a style change reaches the copies of a bar on other
    screens (mirror), so a dimmed or highlighted button looks the same
    on every screen.
  * The pulse module is built (Build-Depends libpulse-dev), for a volume
    control in an sfwbar panel.
  * FlickOS patch: a window's icon comes from its app's own desktop file
    before an icon named like its app id, as in waybar, so Thunar shows
    its menu icon in the dock and window list.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:32:32 +0800

